// ============================================================
// FILE: TraderSellPopup.layout  (compact sell window, v5 - vanilla look)
//
// v5 changes (one pass with the buy window):
//  * vanilla widget styles only, verified against gui/looknfeel/dayzwidgets.styles:
//      PanelWidget  -> DayZDefaultPanel (the same style the vanilla inspect window
//                      and the ESC menu use), rover_sim_black for inner strips
//      ButtonWidget -> MenuDefault / EmptyHighlight
//      SliderWidget -> Default, ProgressBarWidget -> Default, TextListboxWidget -> Default
//      TextWidget   -> Normal / Bold  (+ explicit sdf_MetronBook24 / sdf_MetronLight24 fonts)
//    NOTE: FrameWidget and ImageWidget have NO styles in dayzwidgets.styles, so a
//    "style" on them does nothing - panels must be PanelWidgetClass.
//  * real in-game icons from the dayz_gui image set (sizes taken from the atlas):
//      quality dot  circle(36x36)   close  icon_x(29x29)
//      status rows: liquid, iconTemperature2, iconDrops, iconHungry1, icon_needle,
//                   icon_bullet, iconBacteria  (38x38 / 29x29 in the atlas)
//      no-trader    icon_out_of_reach(67x65)    sell button  iconArrowUp(22x14)
//  * anchor bug fix: right_ref / bottom_ref offsets are measured INWARD (verified on
//      517 vanilla cases, 90% vs 59%). v4 used negative offsets = outward, which
//      clipped the close button (7 px), the sell button (6 px) and pushed the amount
//      text 26 px outside the window.
//  * fonts per vanilla distribution: Light24 @18 (body/status), Book24 @24 (item name),
//      Book24 @22 (price, sell button).
// ============================================================
